static.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/a58dadf32201560924610e32cf1b4f26.avif?t=1786658177\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >» 16 mercenary characters, each individually voiced with different personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >» 5 classes with 115 unique skills and special passive perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > » Unlimited skill respec for endless experimentation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >» Reanimate the dead to  transform into a special class, called Revenant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >» 17 character specific attributes to fine-tune the combat style even further. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >» 370 Steam achievements, view progression directly in the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >» 7 challenge modes with Leaderboards to replay the game with alternative rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >» New Game+ mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/f6d736d466278a373379379a51f22e77.avif?t=1786658177\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >» Find and upgrade hundreds of weapons, consumables and gadgets for your squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >» Over 150 unique items that enhance your skills and transform your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >» Meet survivors to join your camp, where they’ll assist you in future missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >» Complete 42 side missions with bonus rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/f1ff903f6b136b66555944cabb6075d0.webp?t=1786658177\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Dead Grid is a turn-based strategy game set in a post-apocalyptic world overrun by zombies, infused with an 80s retro vibe. Lead a squad of elite mercenaries, fight re